<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot beef trade 1115 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot beef trade 1115 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Utility carcasses steady; Cutter not established. Demand and offerings moderate - USDA</p>
<p>--</p>
<p>COW and BULL CARCASS FOB OMAHA 3.0 Loads Reported.</p>
<p>			  Lds     Price Range    Latest Estb. Mkt.</p>
<p>UT,brk 2-4 450#/up  1.0   66.00		 66.00</p>
<p>UT,bng 1-3 400#/up  2.0   70.00		 70.00</p>
<p>Cutter 1-2 350#/up				  unq</p>
<p>Bulls YG 1 500#/up				  unq</p>
<p>BONELESS PROCESSING BEEF/BEEF TRIMMINGS 34.0  Loads Reported.</p>
<p>Fresh lean boneless beef generally steady; other lean percentages firm early. Demand and offerings light to moderate, USDA said.</p>
